     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Where do you ideally use the »smartCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER »smartCheck« is a high-precision system for measuring and checking tools directly on the shop floor. It helps to check tools precisely and ensure that they meet the required standards.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1775",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Which tools is »smartCheck« suitable for?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER »smartCheck« is versatile and suitable for a wide range of tools, including milling, turning and grinding tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1773",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How easy is it to use the »smartCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER »smartCheck« is designed to be very user-friendly and intuitive. Your employees can learn the system quickly and integrate it into their daily processes.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1771",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What advantages does »smartCheck« offer my company?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER »smartCheck« increases the precision and quality of your tools, saves time and costs, offers comprehensive documentation and can be used flexibly for different tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1769",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How can I integrate »smartCheck« into my existing system?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER »smartCheck« can be easily integrated into your existing production environment. Our team will support you with installation and training to ensure a seamless implementation.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1767",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Is there a way to test the »smartCheck« before I buy it?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, we offer you the opportunity to test ZOLLER »smartCheck« in your production environment. Contact us for a free demo and see the benefits for yourself.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1765",
          "bg": "",
